{"1902060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hoverise Rebellion", "steam_appid": 1902060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4770270], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master this fast-paced Vehicular Arena Shooter where movement is your ultimate weapon.</strong> In a future devastated by an AI rebellion, humanity’s survival rests on elite pilots capable of unleashing the <strong>HoverTanks</strong>: advanced war machines that bridge the gap between fighter jets and heavy armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the legendary mechanical skill of <strong>Unreal Tournament</strong> and the movement of <strong>GunZ: The Duel</strong>, Hoverise Rebellion delivers a competitive experience where your ability to navigate the arena is just as lethal as your aim. Forget slow, clunky tanks. This is high-octane aerial combat on the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/c688b2f735d328cb22afd388c2591442.poster.avif?t=1781562701\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/c688b2f735d328cb22afd388c2591442.webm?t=1781562701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/c688b2f735d328cb22afd388c2591442.mp4?t=1781562701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOUR HOVERTANK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/67ac99ce131e7154ab3256c64b70fb83.avif?t=1781562701\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras_big/67ac99ce131e7154ab3256c64b70fb83.webp?t=1781562701 width=1560 height=602 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoverise Rebellion focuses on specialized Combat Series. Choose the chassis that fits your tactical philosophy and master its unique combat specs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Initial Deployment:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interceptor Series:</strong> Built for aggressive frontline breaches. High-speed propulsion systems and assault weapons designed to shred targets in close-quarters dogfights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialized Series:</strong> New sniper and kamikaze series incoming! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unlock new series, you must win the <strong>HoverTank Challenge</strong>. Complete missions and battle against an unstable AI to earn your next machine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE ARENAS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/4776c8992ff17e1c6cd0d8d4c94cf5f7.poster.avif?t=1781562701\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/4776c8992ff17e1c6cd0d8d4c94cf5f7.webm?t=1781562701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/4776c8992ff17e1c6cd0d8d4c94cf5f7.mp4?t=1781562701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastery of movement is what separates a recruit from a legend. Our system rewards dedicated pilots who learn the verticality of the HoverTanks. Utilize advanced abilities: Jumps, Dashes, and 3D Boosts across challenging, multi-leveled arenas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ARENA GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy classic arena action! But remember, victory isn't always about the kill count. Hoverise Rebellion features high-stakes modes designed for coordinated play.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic DeathMatch &amp; Team Deathmatch:</strong> Pure mechanical skill tests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Domination:</strong> Fight for control of energy nodes. A mode that tests your team's ability to rotate quickly and hold territory under fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assault Mode:</strong> Engage in intense, multi-stage asymmetrical battles where strategy meets explosive action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/03a51a1ed515e66f44f1f5c8596f22a5.avif?t=1781562701\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras_big/03a51a1ed515e66f44f1f5c8596f22a5.webp?t=1781562701 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The rebellion has begun. The machines are evolving. Do you have the skill to hunt them down? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Hoverise Rebellion to your wishlist and claim your place in the arena!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master this fast-paced Vehicular Arena Shooter where movement is your ultimate weapon.</strong> In a future devastated by an AI rebellion, humanity’s survival rests on elite pilots capable of unleashing the <strong>HoverTanks</strong>: advanced war machines that bridge the gap between fighter jets and heavy armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the legendary mechanical skill of <strong>Unreal Tournament</strong> and the movement of <strong>GunZ: The Duel</strong>, Hoverise Rebellion delivers a competitive experience where your ability to navigate the arena is just as lethal as your aim. Forget slow, clunky tanks. This is high-octane aerial combat on the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/c688b2f735d328cb22afd388c2591442.poster.avif?t=1781562701\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/c688b2f735d328cb22afd388c2591442.webm?t=1781562701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/c688b2f735d328cb22afd388c2591442.mp4?t=1781562701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOUR HOVERTANK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/67ac99ce131e7154ab3256c64b70fb83.avif?t=1781562701\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras_big/67ac99ce131e7154ab3256c64b70fb83.webp?t=1781562701 width=1560 height=602 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoverise Rebellion focuses on specialized Combat Series. Choose the chassis that fits your tactical philosophy and master its unique combat specs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Initial Deployment:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interceptor Series:</strong> Built for aggressive frontline breaches. High-speed propulsion systems and assault weapons designed to shred targets in close-quarters dogfights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialized Series:</strong> New sniper and kamikaze seri