where strategy meets explosive action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras/03a51a1ed515e66f44f1f5c8596f22a5.avif?t=1781562701\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/extras_big/03a51a1ed515e66f44f1f5c8596f22a5.webp?t=1781562701 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The rebellion has begun. The machines are evolving. Do you have the skill to hunt them down? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Hoverise Rebellion to your wishlist and claim your place in the arena!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Master this fast-paced Vehicular Arena Shooter where movement is your ultimate weapon. Forget clunky tanks. Pilot agile war machines, defy gravity with 3D boosts, master your abilities, and crush the AI rebellion across multiple Arena Game Modes. Skill is everything here.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/5ba8371bebba625e313de1a26552df5d40990d83/header.jpg?t=1781562701", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/642dea3102661dafbcf2719b696a673680a1e208/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781562701", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902060/642dea3102661dafbcf2719b696a673680a1e208/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781562701", "website": "https://zeakgames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3<br></li><li>